# 统一以 LF 存储，避免跨平台 diff 噪声
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# Markdown / 文本按文本处理并在 diff 中显示
*.md text diff
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text
*.rs text
